A '''hyperlane''' ran through the southern part of the [[Expansion Region]], linking four of [[the galaxy]]'s major [[super-hyperroute]]s.<ref name="Map" /> It began at [[Harrin system|Harrin]] in the [[Inner Rim Territories]] along the [[Rimma Trade Route]] and ran southeast to [[Wroona]] on the nearby [[Corellian Trade Spine]], then to [[Stobar]], and further southeast to where it crossed the [[Hydian Way]] north of [[Pax]]. It met the<ref name="Map" /> [[Enarc Run]]<ref name="Enarc" /> at the [[Kira system]] and then curved northeast until it met the [[Corellian Run]] at the [[Milagro system]],<ref name="Map" /> though it continued a short ways past Milagro and ended where it joined the<ref name="TFABG" /> [[Gamor Run]].<ref name="Gamor" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this route was known as the [[Harrin Trade Corridor]], and originated in the [[1993]] [[West End Games]] sourcebook [[Twin Stars of Kira (sourcebook)|''Twin Stars of Kira'']].<ref name="Kira">[[Twin Stars of Kira (sourcebook)|''Twin Stars of Kira'']]</ref>

